<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="site-container section max-w-3xl prose-like">
    <h1 class="display">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-ink-muted">This policy describes how <%= site.legalName %> handles information submitted through this website. It is a baseline notice and should be reviewed by legal counsel before public launch.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-10 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">What we collect</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-muted">Contact forms, employer enquiries, and candidate applications may include name, email, phone, location, role preferences, messages, and uploaded resumes.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">How we use it</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-muted">Information is used to respond to enquiries and to consider candidates for suitable opportunities. We do not publish resumes or candidate records on the public website.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Storage</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-muted">Files are stored outside the public web directory. Access is limited to authorised recruitment staff when an administration system is introduced.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-ink-muted">Privacy requests can be sent through the contact form until a dedicated email address is published.</p>
  </div>
</section>
